@startuml HU09_Liquidacion_secuencia
title HU-09 — Liquidación automática de colateral\nState + Command

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Admin / Sistema"                  as Admin
boundary    "Frontend (React)"                 as UI
control     "loanController"                   as LC
participant "authMiddleware\nprotect + authorize('admin')" as MW
participant "LiquidationService"               as LIQ
participant "ILoanState\nACTIVE/LIQUIDATING/LIQUIDATED" as ST
participant "LiquidateCommand <<Command>>"     as CMD
participant "LedgerService"                    as LED
participant "NotificationService"              as NTF
database    "PostgreSQL\n(loans, liquidations)" as DB

autonumber

note over LC, LIQ
  Dos disparadores: (a) MonitorRiesgo al detectar LTV crítico (auto),
  (b) POST /api/loans/:id/liquidate (manual, requiere rol admin · HU-13).
end note

== Camino manual (RBAC) ==
Admin -> UI : Liquidar préstamo
UI -> LC : POST /api/loans/{id}/liquidate (JWT)
LC -> MW : protect + authorize('admin')
alt rol != admin
    MW --> LC : 403 Forbidden
    LC --> UI : 403 (queda registrado)
else rol admin
    MW --> LC : next()

    LC -> LIQ : liquidateManual(loanId, actorRole='admin')
    activate LIQ
    LIQ -> DB : Loan.findByPk(loanId, include Offer)
    DB --> LIQ : loan

    LIQ -> ST : canLiquidate()  (estado actual del préstamo)
    activate ST
    alt loan.status != 'active' (no liquidable)
        ST --> LIQ : false
        LIQ --> LC : throw Error('préstamo no liquidable')
        LC --> UI : 400 { message }
    else liquidable
        ST --> LIQ : true (ACTIVE -> LIQUIDATING)
        deactivate ST

        LIQ -> CMD : new LiquidateCommand(loan, this, context).execute()
        activate CMD
        CMD -> LIQ : transition + persist
        LIQ -> DB : loan.update(status='liquidated', liquidationDate=now)
        LIQ -> DB : Liquidation.create({loanId, ltvAtLiquidation,\ncollateralSeized, amountRecovered, reason})
        DB --> LIQ : liquidation

        LIQ -> LED : record(lenderId, 'LIQUIDATION', amountRecovered,\n'liquidation', liquidation.id)
        LED -> DB : LedgerEntry.create({..., balanceAfter})
        LIQ -> LED : record(borrowerId, 'RELEASE', collateralSeized,\n'liquidation', liquidation.id)
        LED -> DB : LedgerEntry.create({..., balanceAfter})

        LIQ -> NTF : notify(borrowerId, 'LIQUIDATION', ...)
        LIQ -> NTF : notify(lenderId, 'LIQUIDATION', ...)
        NTF -> DB : Notification.create(...) x2

        CMD --> LIQ : { liquidation }
        deactivate CMD
        LIQ --> LC : { liquidation, ledgerEntries, notifications }
        deactivate LIQ
        LC --> UI : 201 { liquidation }
    end
end

== Consulta ==
UI -> LC : GET /api/loans/{id}/liquidation (JWT)
LC -> DB : Liquidation.findOne({ loanId })
DB --> LC : liquidation
LC --> UI : 200 { liquidation }

note over Admin, DB
  QA: LiquidationService.test.js (State+Command, LTV<95 no liquida,
  RBAC 403). Integra escenarios de calidad 4 (RBAC) y 5 (auditabilidad).
end note

@enduml
